# Files that never run in the deployed function.
#
# Vercel bundles the project directory into each function, and bundle size is
# paid on every cold start. None of the below is reachable from api/index.js:
# the suites run in CI and on a laptop, the scripts are operator tools driven
# from a terminal, and nodemon is a dev-only watcher.
#
# scripts/ also holds sample HoloMotion reports — real athletes' assessments,
# gitignored and never committed, but excluded here too so that a future change
# to that policy cannot quietly ship clinical PDFs to a public host.

tests/
scripts/
nodemon.json

# The OCR model cache. Written at runtime into the platform temp directory
# (see utils/redactName.js); a copy from a developer's machine is dead weight.
.tesseract/
